            "No extra native overrides: v2 fixes max_fe=4, initialization/population=2, evaluation timeout60; total proposal attempts8 and initialization attempts3. Exact model is selected by the pinned configuration overlay."
          ],
          "limitations": [
            "Native code rewrites problems/bpp_online/gpt.py; the recipe runs only in the isolated source workspace.",
            "Native evaluator and validation scores remain separate native artifacts; no canonical Arena score is inferred.",
            "The pinned OpenAI YAML has a placeholder credential. Supply a secret-free config overlay using ${oc.env:OPENAI_API_KEY}; do not put credentials in JSON specs or config files.",
            "Versioned pilot hooks change the prompt function name to priority_v{version} and bound entry to native proposal operators. Search operators, parser, scoring, tree selection and validation remain native.",
            "Budget exhaustion exits75 and retains partial evidence; it is not native completion. Proposal attempts are not API calls: native parser/SDK retries and post-thought requests remain.",
            "The native max_fe target4 is checked between full tree rounds: healthy initialization2 plus first-round5 candidate attempts totals7. The explicit8-attempt cap bounds retry overshoot; initialization is separately capped3 to retain first-round capacity.",
            "Gateway temperature/max_tokens/top_p controls are recorded but not enforced."
          ],
          "protected_args": [
            "--attempt-budget",
            "--init-attempt-budget"
          ],
